OL,3,AWhy students are being paid #2,000 to
OL,4,Aplay computer games
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo roll up the next generation of
OL,7,Fgamers, who this year can apply for as
OL,8,Fesports scholarship from the University
OL,9,Fof Roehampton - with more than 100
OL,10,Fhanded out so far.
OL,12,FBut can the students balance their
OL,13,Fstudies and their esports? And is the
OL,14,Fscholarship set to catch on?
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
