OL,3,ATikTok to pay $400m to US in one of
OL,4,Alargest child privacy settlements
OL,5,
OL,6,FTikTok has agreed to pay $400m (#293m)
OL,7,Fto the US to end a lawsuit alleging its
OL,8,Fplatform violated children's privacy,
OL,9,Fmarking one of the largest ever
OL,10,Fsettlements over the issue.
OL,12,FThe deal stems from a 2024 suit by the
OL,13,FDepartment of Justice under former
OL,14,FPresident Joe Biden alleging TikTok and
OL,15,Fits parent company ByteDance collected
OL,16,F"vast amounts of data" on millions of
OL,17,Fusers under the age of 13.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11906
SC,0006
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787539691
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ATikTok to pay $400m to US in one of
OL,4,Alargest child privacy settlements
OL,5,
OL,6,FDoing so was against the Children's
OL,7,FOnline Privacy Protection Act (COPPA),
OL,8,Fa federal law enacted in 2000. It is
OL,9,Fthe same law that dozens of US states
OL,10,Fare now suing Meta over.
OL,12,F"Children and parents are better
OL,13,Fprotected today than they were when
OL,14,Fthis case began," assistant Attorney
OL,15,FGeneral Brett Shumate said.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
