OL,3,ADavis 'grateful' for support over
OL,4,Acancer diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FActress Lucy Davis has told fans she is
OL,7,F"grateful" for their support as she
OL,8,Fmade an appearance at a London sci-fi
OL,9,Fconvention, following the recent
OL,10,Frevelation she has incurable breast
OL,11,Fcancer.
OL,13,FThe 53-year-old star was appearing at
OL,14,Fthe For The Love of Fantasy & Sci-Fi
OL,15,Fconvention at Excel London on Saturday,
OL,16,Fless than two weeks after announcing
OL,17,Fher diagnosis in a post on Instagram.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11913
SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787539691
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADavis 'grateful' for support over
OL,4,Acancer diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavis, who was on a panel to talk about
OL,7,Fher role in the 2004 zombie-comedy
OL,8,FShaun of the Dead, told an audience of
OL,9,Fhundreds of people about the
OL,10,Finteractions she had enjoyed with the
OL,11,Ffilm's fans during the event.
OL,13,F"It's like this whole second family you
OL,14,Fnever knew you had, everyone is like a
OL,15,Fcommunity, friendly, supportive of not
OL,16,Fonly us but you guys and each other,"
OL,17,Fshe said. "We need a bit more niceness
OL,18,Fin the world, so I'm grateful."
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
